 to install, activate or update the plugin.\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \"#wpcontent\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"isClickable\": false,             \"htmlContent\": \"Now you have been given an overview of the plugin browser.\\n\\n_If you did not start the tour from here, we will send you back to your last page in the next step. Otherwise, the tour is over for this section._ 😊\"         },         {             \"type\": \"redirect\",             \"page\": \"plugins\",             \"urlParams\": {                 \"tour_index\": 5             }         }     ],     \"users\": [         {             \"type\": \"guide\",             \"children\": [                 {                     \"imageUrl\": \"https://s3-de-central.profitbricks.com/web-hosting/ionos/live/assets/journey/journey.png\",                     \"headline\": \"User Management\",                     \"htmlContent\": \"In the user management, you have an overview of all user accounts created on your website.\"                 },                 {                     \"imageUrl\": \"https://s3-de-central.profitbricks.com/web-hosting/ionos/live/assets/journey/journey.png\",                     \"headline\": \"Roles\",                     \"htmlContent\": \"Control capabilities by new roles to users.\"                 }             ]         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \".manage-column.column-username\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"htmlContent\": \"This column displays each user’s username and profile picture.\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \".manage-column.column-role\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"htmlContent\": \"Each user can be assigned roles via the user management. Different rights are also assigned through these roles.\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \"#new_role\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"htmlContent\": \"To assign a new role to an existing user, place a checkmark next to the users, go to the **Change Role To** selector and choose the desired role.\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \".page-title-action\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"isClickable\": true,             \"htmlContent\": \"You can use this button to create a new user.\\n\\nDo you want to learn more about creating users? Then just click this button.\\n\\nOtherwise, you can continue as usual.\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \"#wpcontent\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"htmlContent\": \"Now you’ve been given an overview of user management.\\n\\n_If you started the tour from the Dashboard, we’ll send you back there in the next step. Otherwise, the tour is over for this section._ 😊\"         },         {             \"type\": \"redirect\",             \"page\": \"index\",             \"urlParams\": {                 \"tour_index\": 10             }         }     ],     \"user\": [         {             \"htmlSelector\": \"#wpcontent\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"htmlContent\": \"Here you can add new user.\\n\\nFields marked with **(required)** must be filled.\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \"#user_login\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"htmlContent\": \"This is where the username is assigned.\\nThe username cannot be changed after it is created.\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \"#email\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"htmlContent\": \"The user’s email address is used to send system emails, such as password reset emails. Also, the mail address can be used instead of the username for login...\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \".form-field.form-required.user-pass1-wrap\",             \"type\": \"focus\",             \"htmlContent\": \"Here, you can assign a password or have one generated.\"         },         {             \"htmlSelector\": \"#role\",    